cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "Solver admissibility and guarded floor selection: code release"
abstract: >-
  Matrix-free GPU finite-element stack, Galerkin geometric-multigrid hierarchy,
  and guarded SIMP density-floor selection policy for three-dimensional topology
  optimization, together with every experiment reported in the accompanying
  paper: held-out preserve/escalate validation, acceptance-guard audits, fixed-floor
  operator-perturbation controls, threshold and stack sensitivity sweeps, and
  in-loop optimization trajectories.
type: software
